    <title type="link" role="trail">Orca Screen Reader</title>
    <desc>
      Orca is a free, open source, flexible, and extensible screen reader that provides access
      to the graphical desktop through customizable combinations of speech and braille. Orca
      works with applications and toolkits that support the Assistive Technology Service
      Provider Interface (AT-SPI). While Orca is part of the GNOME Project, it can be used in
      any accessible desktop environment.
    </desc>
